OL,3,GNEWSAEx-paratrooper gets UK's first
OL,4,Abionic upper arm
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former paratrooper whose arm was torn
OL,7,Foff in a motorcycle crash has become
OL,8,Fthe first person in the UK to be fitted
OL,9,Fwith a pioneering new type of bionic
OL,10,Fupper arm.
OL,12,FMilos Stankovic, 63, from Plymouth, a
OL,13,Fformer Parachute Regiment officer, said
OL,14,Fhe lost his left arm and nearly died in
OL,15,Fthe crash that happened outside
OL,16,FValladolid in northern Spain in 2025.
OL,18,FDeveloped by Bristol-based Open
OL,19,FBionics, the new lightweight and hollow
OL,20,F3D-printed limb was designed for an
OL,21,Fabove-elbow amputation, known medically
OL,22,Fas a transhumeral prosthesis.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
