OL,3,GNEWSAEx-paratrooper gets UK's first
OL,4,Abionic upper arm
OL,5,
OL,6,FStankovic said he was "very lucky" to
OL,7,Fbe "the first person in Britain" to be
OL,8,Ffitted with the prosthetic and hoped it
OL,9,Fwould allow him to return to extreme
OL,10,Fsports.
